</region>
<region region-id="73" left="18.00" top="1111.20" width="572.00" height="43.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="1121.20" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Governing records of Pier_Fixed.XML for each check (index g). FBMP axial force is converted to compression positive. The drag load DR = DD is added to the axial force at every station (LRFD Table 3.4.1-1, 10.7.3.7): gamma_DR for the limit state of the record. Downdrag is not in the Factored Design Load.</p></text>
