<region region-id="270" left="18.00" top="5843.81" width="572.00" height="50.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="5852.31" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">The notebook lists 11 PENDING items; the distilled ratios below do not close them: Local buckling class · nonslender (D/t vs 0.11 E/Fy); Tension · maximum strength uplift; Pile Data Table completeness (SDM 11.4); Corrosion allowance; Environment classification; Pile-to-cap connection (12 in embedment); Downdrag source documented; FBMP export current; Minimum tip elevation; Scour resistance and elevations; Drivability.</p></text>
